# Graph dumps: timestamped backups written by `medaka export`. Regenerable from
# the graph, and a new file every run, so they are kept out of history. The
# dossiers under data/dossier/ ARE committed - their diffs are how a reviewer
# sees what changed in the knowledge base.
data/export/
